        "tags": [
          "cancellation"
        ],
        "summary": "Confirm Cancellation Endpoint",
        "description": "Secure Server-Side Cancellation Submission:\n1. Validates form data (booking_reference, reason).\n2. Generates trusted inter-agent JWT (JWT_SECRET_KEY never leaves server).\n3. Builds AgentMessage envelope (sender: passenger-agent -> receiver: booking-agent, intent: cancel_booking).\n4. Posts to Central Agent Communication Hub (/messages).\n5. Fallback directly through in-memory CancellationService if Hub process is offline.",
        "operationId": "confirm_cancellation_endpoint_api_cancellations_confirm_post",
        "requestBody": {
